-- S12.6-01 no report of a name matter -> the power is not triggered (src:365)
#ASSERT `Art 12(6) the decision of the Commissioner on whether to require the charity to apply` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

GIVEN nm IS A STRING, related IS A BOOLEAN, undesirableInContext IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Name used by a registered charity`
`ind-a used` nm related undesirableInContext MEANS
    `Name used by a registered charity` WITH
        `name used` IS nm
        `previous registered names of the charity` IS LIST "Hope for Jersey"
        `related to one of the charity's registered names` IS related
        `undesirable within Article 12(1) in the context in which it is used, in the opinion of the Commissioner` IS undesirableInContext

GIVEN u IS A `Name used by a registered charity`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`ind-a may use` u MEANS `Art 12(7) the name used is permitted` `ind-a K` `ind-a registered Hope` u

-- S12.7-01 its registered name; one of its registered names (an alternative) -> permitted (src:367)
#ASSERT `ind-a may use` (`ind-a used` "Hope Jersey" FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `ind-a may use` (`ind-a used` "Hope" FALSE FALSE)
-- S12.7-02 a related name not undesirable in context -> permitted (src:368-370)
#ASSERT `ind-a may use` (`ind-a used` "Hope JSY" TRUE FALSE)
-- S12.7-03 a related name undesirable in context -> prohibited (src:370)
#ASSERT NOT `ind-a may use` (`ind-a used` "Hope Jersey Bank" TRUE TRUE)
-- S12.7-04 an unrelated trading name -> prohibited (src:368-369)
#ASSERT NOT `ind-a may use` (`ind-a used` "Island Bargains" FALSE FALSE)
-- S12.7-06 using a prohibited name breaches the prohibition (src:366)
-- EXPECT: BREACH
#TRACE `Art 12(7) a registered charity must not use a name other than a registered or related name` `ind-a K` `ind-a registered Hope` (`ind-a used` "Island Bargains" FALSE FALSE) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `a registered charity` DOES (`Act under Article 12` OF `a registered charity`, (`use a name` "Island Bargains")) AT 1
